 title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Grounds\">Seacrest Grounds</a> when <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quara Renegades</a> are not spawning.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA seacrest serpent attacks in melee range. A seacrest serpent never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tUse death-reduction items to decrease incoming damage, and stay diagonal to avoid their waves. Their beams aren't avoidable if you are adjacent to the creature.\n</p><p><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>:</b> This creature's melee tends to be very high on top of dealing heavy Death Damage. A combination of <a href=\"#/wiki/Koshei%27s%20Ancient%20Amulet\">Koshei's Ancient Amulet</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Moon%20Mirror\">Moon Mirror</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Butterfly%20Ring\">Butterfly Ring</a> and maybe a <a href=\"#/wiki/Skullcracker%20Armor\">Skullcracker Armor</a>/<a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20Armor\">Yalahari Armor</a> can be used to reduce incoming damage from them. Avoid fighting more than two at time because their damage really adds up, specially if accompanied by <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpents</a>. Standing diagonal may be useful as well.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on May 14, 2024, the patch increased experience from 2,600 to 2,900, increased earth sensitivity from 90% to 95%, and increased energy sensitivity from 90% to 100% as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 7,490 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Platinum Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Platinum_Coin_c8a106.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-5</td>\n<td>2.7</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Seacrest Scale\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Seacrest_Scale_ef3c8d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Seacrest Scale</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</t